{
  "_about": "LANDMARKS M1 (design docs/design/island-resources.md section 3.4/5.1, approved 2026-10-29). The named sites an expedition island is scouted for: 'types' holds the eight landmark kinds of the design doc and their placement rules; 'climates' holds, per climate, the site rows an island of that climate can draw (type, display name, weight, must, max sites, and the node group's families). IslandLandmarks (game/scripts/world/island_landmarks.gd) reads this file during the island build: it draws site rows by weight without repeating a row past 'max', guarantees the climate's 'must' rows first, samples candidate tiles that pass the type's terrain tokens, and rejects anything that fails the validation rules below. Every number is # ASSUMPTION (the doc marks its starting values *ASSUMPTION*); logged in the report and docs/vision/WildLandsMMO_Open_Questions.md.",
