    "_spacing_note": "# ASSUMPTION: 45 m between landmark centres on expedition islands, 30 m on the home island (doc section 3.3).",
    "_landing_note": "# ASSUMPTION: no landmark centre inside the 60 m camp clearing or 36 m of the landing point (the doc keeps the dock area calm; 25 m is the landing ring, +11 m for the node group).",
    "_floor_note": "# ASSUMPTION: when a small island cannot hold the budget's minimum at the doc's spacing, the fill round packs sites at 0.6 x that spacing (27 m unstable, 18 m home) instead of shipping half the budget. Each find stays a separate destination; the doc's 45 m still applies to every drawn site.",
    "_near_note": "One site per island is clamped into [landing_clear_m + 6, near_landing_m] when its ring band allows it, so the first find is within ~30 s of running from camp (doc section 3.3).",
    "_budgets_note": "Per kind: the doc's section 5.1 table, by tier band. An island row may override with its own landmark_budget [min, max].",
