    "_gold_note": "# ASSUMPTION (doc section 5.6): a find pays 20 Gold at tier 15 rising linearly to 60 at tier 60 (clamped outside). Home and other islands below 15 pay the tier-15 value.",
    "joy_fatigue": -20,
    "_joy_note": "Doc section 5.6: the first find per island also gives the CURRENT Joy of Discovery fatigue drop (rules.json craters.discover_fatigue, 20).",
    "hand_bonus": {
      "tier_step": 0.05,
      "chance_mult": 1.5
    },
    "_hand_note": "Doc section 5.2 / 5.7: a landmark node's HAND harvest raises the perk-tier step by +0.05 and the rare-trait chance x1.5 (the cap x1.5 too). Tribe work never gets it: ASSIGN jobs skip landmark nodes. # ASSUMPTION values from the doc.",
