      "min_tier": 30,
      "per_island": 1,
      "open_cost_gold": 50,
      "window_s": 1200,
      "interact_m": 4.0
    },
    "_dormant_note": "Doc section 5.3 (A3): from island tier 30 exactly one landmark per island is dormant (# ASSUMPTION: one even at 50-60, the doc's 1-2 left for tuning). It shows sealed on the map once found and opens at the site for open_cost_gold Gold (rules.json craters.open_cost_tstones 50); its nodes then grow for window_s seconds of play (# ASSUMPTION: the doc's '20 game-minutes' read as 20 minutes of play, a game minute is 0.5 s), after which unharvested nodes wither. Never a Warp Gem cost.",
